ement\\n\\n\\nDr Lucile CAVAILLES\\nMédecin généraliste\\n2 chemin de la chaine 26200 MONTELIMAR\\n04.75.51.87.02\\n","<p>Bonjour</p><p>Comme convenu hier, je vous transmets les infos compl&eacute;mentaires.</p><p>Dimension imprimante secr&eacute;tariat : profondeur min 44 cm (capot ouvert et<br/>c&acirc;bles compris).<br/>Dimension imprimante bureau: profondeur 41 cm c&acirc;bles compris.</p><p>Ci joint un croquis avec les dimensions id&eacute;ales de l&apos;espace &quot;examen&quot;</p><p>&Eacute;galement joint, la photo de l&apos;inspiration pour le rangement bureau et pour<br/>l&apos;accueil.</p><p>Dans l&apos;attente de votre retour,</p><p>Bien cordialement</p><p>Dr Lucile CAVAILLES<br/>M&eacute;decin g&eacute;n&eacute;raliste<br/>2 chemin de la chaine 26200 MONTELIMAR<br/>04.75.51.87.02</p>","Éléments complémentaires","2026-09-24T07:37:34.000Z",{"value":"217","html":"218","text":"219"},{"value":"220","html":"221","text":"179"},"<CAAKG0XcrCN4WxS=jboK3C30ZKx9c_M9x1Qv8e=pqPABic9w4_A@mail.gmail.com>",{"uid":3294},{"mimeType":"222","fileType":"223","fileExtension":"224","data":"225","fileName":"226","id":"227","fileSize":"228","bytes":2557275},{"mimeType":"229","fileType":"223","fileExtension":"230","data":"225","fileName":"231","id":"232","fileSize":"233","bytes":160793},{"mimeType":"229","fileType":"223","fileExtension":"230","data":"225","fileName":"234","id":"235","fileSize":"236","bytes":139063},{"mimeType":"229","fileType":"223","fileExtension":"230","data":"225","fileName":"237","id":"238","fileSize":"239","bytes":129120},{"generations":"240"},{"completionTokens":112,"promptTokens":959,"totalTokens":1071},["241"],{"anthropic_api_key":"242","model":"243","anthropic_api_url":"244","max_tokens":16384,"invocation_kwargs":"245","client_options":"246","streaming":false,"api_key":"247"},"```json\\n{\\n  \\"categorie\\": \\"suivi_client\\",\\n  \\"urgent\\": false,\\n  \\"resume\\": \\"Le Dr Cavailles (médecin à Montélimar) transmet les dimensions des imprimantes et