; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAAA4AAAAABhfFFA.540qF2GrBvg\\"><img alt=\\"facebook\\" width=\\"24\\" height=\\"24\\" style=\\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\\" src=\\"https://img.signitic.app/uploads/icon_XZXZXZ0f1553_rond_facebook.png\\"></a></div>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2; vertical-align: top; width: 31px; height: 24px;\\">\\n<div style=\\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABIAAAAABhfFFA.7FTjlmMI7EU\\"><img alt=\\"instagram\\" width=\\"24\\" height=\\"24\\" style=\\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\\" src=\\"https://img.signitic.app/uploads/icon_XZXZXZ0f1553_rond_instagram.png\\"></a></div>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2; vertical-align: top; width: 31px; height: 24px;\\">\\n<div style=\\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABMAAAAABhfFFA.EcDqZAYhBXo\\"><img alt=\\"youtube\\" width=\\"24\\" height=\\"24\\" style=\\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\\" src=\\"https://img.signitic.app/uploads/icon_XZXZXZ0f1553_rond_youtube.png\\"></a></div>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p style=\\"line-height: 1; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 1em;\\"><img alt=\\"FR - INTL - GTI 2026\\" width=\\"600\\" height=\\"256\\" style=\\"width: 600px; height: 256px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\" src=\\"https://img.signitic.app/w/01K9VSHTVRG7X69QTZD9A555VE/m/781a46a3c50f79c155f88c7f86523395.jpg\\"></p>\\n<div style=\\"width: 600px; display: inline-block;\\">\\n<p style=\\"text-align: left; line-height: 1; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: arial; font-size: 8px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<span style=\\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px;\\">This e-mail message and any attachment hereto are intended only for the above-mentioned recipient(s). Their contents are confidential. If you received this e-mail in error, please notify us immediately,\\n and delete it as well as any attachment, without making any copy, nor disclosing the contents, nor taking any action based thereon. Thank you.<br>\\n</span><span style=\\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\\">Please consider the environment before printing this e-mail.</span></p>\\n</div>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n","Hello Valentin,\\n\\nComme discuté hier au téléphone,\\n\\nNous allons modifier le showroom de vaise :\\n\\n\\n  *\\n1 meuble RSE immobile (sans roulettes)\\nTable de 1m20 de large 0,65 épaisseur + espace pour visuel (124 cm large X170 cm haut et porte brochure (40 cm de large de chaque côté)\\nCe meuble sera dans la partie gauche du showroom (voir ci-dessous), je te laisse adapter les dimensions suivant la place donnée.\\n\\n[cid:d647ddb6-520a-48eb-a1a6-342c6124b4a1][cid:91af4630-b998-43b3-95b6-4aeced5e19f4]\\n\\n  *\\n1 meuble exposition sol/mur + espace café\\n1 estrade de 10cm avec 3 produits posés au sol et 3 produits au mur (1m78), à encastrer pour être à la même épaisseur + à gauche 1 meuble avec porte push et 2 étagères de rangement (89cm) + 1 niche de carte et 1 plan de travail pour poser machine à hauteur d'homme.\\n\\n              [cid:795e3e97-5430-4f77-89c4-15b905229473]\\n\\nSi tu as des questions, n'hésite pas.\\n\\nDans l'ordre des priorités sur ce que je t'ai donné, peux-tu stp commencer par le showroom de Tarare, puis Vaise puis les meubles de Maldegem ?\\n\\nMerci beaucoup\\n\\nBonne journée\\n\\n\\nJeanne VEKEMANS\\nChargée de communication\\n\\n[img] +33 7 72 72 58 50\\n[img] +33 7 72 72 58 50\\n\\njeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com<mailto:jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com>\\n\\n[GERFLOR SAS]\\n[linkedin]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABAAAAAABhfFFA.IuOSGxWyBVM>\\n[facebook]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAAA4AAAAABhfFFA.540qF2GrBvg>\\n[instagram]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABIAAAAABhfFFA.7FTjlmMI7EU>\\n[youtube]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABMAAAAABhfFFA.EcDqZAYhBXo>\\n\\n[FR - INTL - GTI 2026]\\n\\nThis e-mail message and any attachment hereto are intended only for the above-mentioned recipient(s). Their contents are confidential. If you received this e-mail in error, please notify us immediately, and delete it as well as any attachment, without making any copy, nor disclosing the contents, nor taking any action based thereon. Thank you.\\nPlease consider the environment before printing this e-mail.\\n","<p>Hello Valentin,</p><p>Comme discut&eacute; hier au t&eacute;l&eacute;phone,</p><p>Nous allons modifier le showroom de vaise :</p><p>  *<br/>1 meuble RSE immobile (sans roulettes)<br/>Table de 1m20 de large 0,65 &eacute;paisseur + espace pour visuel (124 cm large X170 cm haut et porte brochure (40 cm de large de chaque c&ocirc;t&eacute;)<br/>Ce meuble sera dans la partie gauche du showroom (voir ci-dessous), je te laisse adapter les dimensions suivant la place donn&eacute;e.</p><p>[cid:d647ddb6-520a-48eb-a1a6-342c6124b4a1][cid:91af4630-b998-43b3-95b6-4aeced5e19f4]</p><p>  *<br/>1 meuble exposition sol/mur + espace caf&eacute;<br/>1 estrade de 10cm avec 3 produits pos&eacute;s au sol et 3 produits au mur (1m78), &agrave; encastrer pour &ecirc;tre &agrave; la m&ecirc;me &eacute;paisseur + &agrave; gauche 1 meuble avec porte push et 2 &eacute;tag&egrave;res de rangement (89cm) + 1 niche de carte et 1 plan de travail pour poser machine &agrave; hauteur d&apos;homme.</p><p>              [cid:795e3e97-5430-4f77-89c4-15b905229473]</p><p>Si tu as des questions, n&apos;h&eacute;site pas.</p><p>Dans l&apos;ordre des priorit&eacute;s sur ce que je t&apos;ai donn&eacute;, peux-tu stp commencer par le showroom de Tarare, puis Vaise puis les meubles de Maldegem ?</p><p>Merci beaucoup</p><p>Bonne journ&eacute;e</p><p>Jeanne VEKEMANS<br/>Charg&eacute;e de communication</p><p>[img] +33 7 72 72 58 50<br/>[img] +33 7 72 72 58 50</p><p><a href=\\"mailto:jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com\\">jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com</a>&lt;<a href=\\"mailto:jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com\\">mailto:jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com</a>&gt;</p><p>[GERFLOR SAS]<br/>[linkedin]&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABAAAAAABhfFFA.IuOSGxWyBVM\\">https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABAAAAAABhfFFA.IuOSGxWyBVM</a>&gt;<br/>[facebook]&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAAA4AAAAABhfFFA.540qF2GrBvg\\">https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAAA4AAAAABhfFFA.540qF2GrBvg</a>&gt;<br/>[instagram]&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABIAAAAABhfFFA.7FTjlmMI7EU\\">https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABIAAAAABhfFFA.7FTjlmMI7EU</a>&gt;<br/>[youtube]&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABMAAAAABhfFFA.EcDqZAYhBXo\\">https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABMAAAAABhfFFA.EcDqZAYhBXo</a>&gt;</p><p>[FR - INTL - GTI 2026]</p><p>This e-mail message and any attachment hereto are intended only for the above-mentioned recipient(s). Their contents are confidential. If you received this e-mail in error, please notify us immediately, and delete it as well as any attachment, without making any copy, nor disclosing the contents, nor taking any action based thereon. Thank you.<br/>Please consider the environment before printing this e-mail.</p>","Chiffrage Vaise","2026-09-16T08:56:49.000Z",{"value":"251","html":"252","text":"253"},{"value":"254","html":"255","text":"178"},"<PAXPR08MB7468633679E7F3F04A244A23FBB92@PAXPR08MB7468.eurprd08.prod.outlook.com>",{"uid":3260},{"mimeType":"256","fileType":"257","fileExtension":"258","data":"259","fileName":"260","id":"261","fileSize":"262","bytes":193421},{"mimeType":"256","fileType":"257","fileExtension":"258","data":"259","fileName":"263","id":"264","fileSize":"265","bytes":284901},{"mimeType":"256","fileType":"257",