votre poche\\n !<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</div>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><b><i><u><span style=\\"mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\\">Pour plus d’informations sur notre offre atelier\\n</span></u></i></b><span style=\\"mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\\">→&nbsp; <a href=\\"https://www.dispano.fr/s/pdf/DISPANO-Service-Ateliers24.pdf\\">\\nhttps://www.dispano.fr/s/pdf/DISPANO-Service-Ateliers24.pdf</a> &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"mso-ligatures:standardcontextual\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n</div>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"mso-fareast-language:EN-US\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\"border:none;border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\\">\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><b><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\">De&nbsp;:</span></b><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\"> Caufriez Valentin &lt;v.caufriez@ebanista.fr&gt;\\n<br>\\n<b>Envoyé&nbsp;:</b> mercredi 16 septembre 2026 12:07<br>\\n<b>À&nbsp;:</b> Cornaire, Vincent &lt;Vincent.Cornaire@Dispano.fr&gt;<br>\\n<b>Objet&nbsp;:</b> Re: Journée commerciale du 1 octobre – Book Outillage Télévente<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\\n<div>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\">Salut Vincent,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n</div>\\n<div>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n</div>\\n<div>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\">Est-ce que tu pourrais me dire combien coûte la virutex FR129VB ?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n</div>\\n<div>\\n<p class=\\"M