b>Cc&nbsp;:</b> Laure Jover &lt;laure.jover@amoc26.fr&gt;<br>\\n<b>Objet&nbsp;:</b> Bureau<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\">Hello,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\">J'espère que vous allez bien.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\">Vous trouverez ci-joint le visuel et le devis concernant le bureau.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\">Bonne journée,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\">Bises<o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<div>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><img width=\\"3084\\" height=\\"896\\" style=\\"width:32.125in;height:9.3333in\\" id=\\"_x0000_i1025\\" src=\\"https://workspace.storage.infomaniak.com/signature/2bb08423c34399f37b77bfe3fa812e8414050d64\\"><o:p></o:p></p>\\n</div>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n</div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n","Ok mais il faut que derrière les étagères ce soit plein.\\n\\n[cid:im